  "name": "Refactor VibeCodingView layout",
  "pinned": false,
  "description": "# Summary\n\n1. **Refactored VibeCodingView** - Removed the separate changes/diff section to simplify the layout and improve user experience.\n\n2. **Added Git Controls to Header** - Integrated branch selector, branch switching, and branch creation directly into the status bar for quick access.\n\n3. **PR Review Mode in Chat** - Implemented a toggle in the chat footer that switches between vibe and prview modes, allowing PR review within the same session without needing a separate panel.\n\n4. **Simplified Two-Panel Layout** - Consolidated the interface to show only Chat and Preview panels with dynamic sizing, removing the three-panel complexity.\n\n5. **Created BranchSelector Component** - Built a reusable dropdown component for branch management with options to switch branches and create new ones from the header.",
